      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Captivating Display",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "arcane",
        "visual"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per 10 minutes\n\n---\n\nEffect The dragon opens the fins on their head, creating a radiant display of enthralling colors. Each creature in a 30-foot emanation must succeed at a DC 33 Will save save or be Dazzled and Slowed 1 (or Slowed 2 on a critical failure) for 1 round. Regardless of the result, a creature is then temporarily immune to Captivating Display for 1 minute.",
